    "guide": {
      "type": "guide-content",
      "blocks": {
        "chapter-setup": {
          "type": "_guide-chapter",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Set up your watch",
            "anchor": "setup"
          },
          "blocks": {
            "article-in-the-box": {
              "type": "_guide-article",
              "settings": {
                "title": "What’s in the box",
                "anchor": "in-the-box"
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text-1": {
                  "type": "_guide-text",
                  "settings": {
                    "content": "<ul><li>JrTrack Pro smartwatch with silicone band</li><li>Charging clip and wall adapter</li><li>Extra velcro band</li><li>Quickstart guide</li></ul>",
                    "show_seal": false
                  }
                },
                "note-1": {
                  "type": "_guide-note",
                  "settings": {
                    "style": "note",
                    "title": "No SIM card to install.",
                    "text": "The JrTrack Pro uses an eSIM, so there is no SIM tray. Cellular service is switched on during setup."
                  }
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text-1",
                "note-1"
              ]
            },
            "article-watch-anatomy": {
              "type": "_guide-article",
              "settings": {
                "title": "Buttons and ports",
                "anchor": "watch-anatomy",
                "image_asset": "jrtrack-watch-hero-609x660.webp",
                "image_alt": "JrTrack Pro seen from the front and to the right, with the orange Power button on top and the ridged Action button below it",
                "caption": "Power on top, Action below it",
                "figure_position": "side",
                "figure_width": "extra-wide",
                "device": "app",
                "callouts": "Power | 58.1 | 24.7 | 79.8 | 16.1\nAction | 60.8 | 35.3 | 81.8 | 45.2"
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text-2": {
                  "type": "_guide-text",
                  "settings": {
                    "content": "<ul><li>The <strong>Power button</strong> is the top button on the right side. Press to wake or sleep the screen and to go back. Hold for Quick Settings or SOS.</li><li>The <strong>Action button</strong> is the bottom button on the right side. It opens your child’s Quick Access app, or does the main action on the current screen, like taking a photo or answering a call.</li><li><strong>Charging contacts</strong> are on the back of the watch.</li></ul><p>See <a href=\"#buttons\">Button navigation</a> for everything each button does.</p>",
                    "show_seal": false
                  }
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text-2"
              ]
            },
            "article-charge": {
              "type": "_guide-article",
              "settings": {
                "title": "Charge it first",
                "anchor": "charge"
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text-3": {
                  "type": "_guide-text",
                  "settings": {
                    "content": "<p>Charge the watch fully before you start setup. Attach the charger to the back of the watch and plug it in. A charging indicator will appear on the screen.</p>",
                    "show_seal": false
                  }
                },
                "note-2": {
                  "type": "_guide-note",
                  "settings": {
                    "style": "tip",
                    "title": "Watch won’t turn on?",
                    "text": "It almost always just needs charging. Leave it on the charger for at least 30 minutes, then try again."
                  }
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text-3",
                "note-2"
              ]
            },
            "article-turn-on": {
              "type": "_guide-article",
              "settings": {
                "title": "Turn it on",
                "anchor": "turn-on"
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text-4": {
                  "type": "_guide-text",
                  "settings": {
                    "content": "<p>Press and hold the Power button for 3 seconds until the screen lights up.</p><p>On first startup the watch shows <strong>Welcome to COSMO</strong>. Tap <strong>Get started</strong>. Let any update finish. If the watch can’t connect, tap <strong>Connect to Wi-Fi</strong> to join your home network.</p>",
                    "show_seal": false
                  }
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text-4"
              ]
            },
            "article-download-app": {
              "type": "_guide-article",
              "settings": {
                "title": "Download the Cosmo app",
                "anchor": "download-app"
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text-5": {
                  "type": "_guide-text",
                  "settings": {
                    "content": "<p>The Cosmo app is how you see your child’s location, manage who can reach them, set Routines, and change settings. Search your app store for <strong>Cosmo: Family Connection</strong>.</p>",
                    "show_seal": false
                  }
                },
                "kv-list-1": {
                  "type": "_guide-kv",
                  "settings": {},
                  "blocks": {
                    "kv-1": {
                      "type": "_guide-kv-row",
                      "settings": {
                        "label": "iOS",
                        "value": "<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/cosmo-family-connection/id6758307772\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Download on the App Store</a>"
                      }
                    },
                    "kv-2": {
                      "type": "_guide-kv-row",
                      "settings": {
                        "label": "Android",
                        "value": "<a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.cosmotogether.cosmoapp\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Get it on Google Play</a>"
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "block_order": [
                    "kv-1",
                    "kv-2"
                  ]
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text-5",
                "kv-list-1"
              ]
            },
            "article-parent-account": {
              "type": "_guide-article",
              "settings": {
                "title": "Create your parent account",
                "anchor": "parent-account"
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text-6": {
                  "type": "_guide-text",
                  "settings": {
                    "content": "<ol><li>Open the Cosmo app and enter your email address.</li><li>Enter the one-time code sent to your email.</li><li>Enter your name, a nickname and your phone number. Your nickname is how you appear on your child’s watch.</li><li>Add a profile photo. It shows on your child’s watch when you call.</li></ol>",
                    "show_seal": false
                  }
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text-6"
              ]
            },
            "article-child-profile": {
              "type": "_guide-article",
              "settings": {
                "title": "Add your child’s profile",
                "anchor": "child-profile",
                "image_asset": "jrtrack-app-onb-child-455x996.webp",
                "image_alt": "Your child's info screen in the Cosmo app with an add photo control, name and birth date fields, and optional gender, height and weight",
                "caption": "Name and birthday, the rest is optional",
                "figure_position": "side",
                "figure_width": "default",
                "device": "app"
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text-7": {
                  "type": "_guide-text",
                  "settings": {
                    "content": "<ol><li>After your own profile, the app prompts you to create your child’s.</li><li>Enter their name and birthday, and add a photo.</li><li>Fill in any of the optional fields, then tap <strong>Finish</strong>.</li></ol><p>Their profile becomes the hub for every setting on the watch. <a href=\"#child-hub\">See what lives inside it</a>.</p>",
                    "show_seal": false
                  }
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text-7"
              ]
            },
            "article-pair": {
              "type": "_guide-article",
              "settings": {
                "title": "Pair the watch and activate",
                "anchor": "pair",
                "image_asset": "jrtrack-app-onb-pair-455x914.webp",
                "image_alt": "Cosmo app showing a found Cosmo JrTrack Pro with its IMEI and a Connect button",
                "caption": "The watch appears by name, with its IMEI",
                "figure_position": "side",
                "figure_width": "default",
                "device": "app"
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text-8": {
                  "type": "_guide-text",
                  "settings": {
                    "content": "<ol><li>On the watch, tap <strong>Continue</strong>. This turns on Bluetooth pairing and can also show a QR code.</li><li>In the app, allow Bluetooth (or camera, for QR) permission when asked. The app looks for the watch automatically.</li><li>When the watch appears, tap <strong>Connect</strong>. If it isn’t found, choose to pair with the QR code and scan the code on the watch.</li><li>If the watch doesn’t have a membership yet, the app asks you to choose a plan and decide whether to add Cosmo Care for device protection.</li><li>Once you purchase your membership, a green check on both screens means pairing was successful.</li><li>Choose your watch settings in the app, and let your child scroll through the short tour on the watch.</li></ol>",
                    "show_seal": false
                  }
                },
                "note-3": {
                  "type": "_guide-note",
                  "settings": {
                    "style": "info",
                    "title": "Every membership includes a 30-day money back guarantee.",
                    "text": ""
                  }
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text-8",
                "note-3"
              ]
            },
            "article-test-call": {
              "type": "_guide-article",
              "settings": {
                "title": "Make a test call",
                "anchor": "test-call"
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text-9": {
                  "type": "_guide-text",
                  "settings": {
                    "content": "<p>Once paired, call the watch to confirm everything works. If the call does not connect, contact Cosmo Support at <a href=\"tel:8772154741\">877-215-4741</a> or <a href=\"mailto:support@cosmotogether.com\">support@cosmotogether.com</a>.</p>",
                    "show_seal": false
                  }
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text-9"
              ]
            },
            "article-wifi": {
              "type": "_guide-article",
              "settings": {
                "title": "Connect to Wi-Fi",
                "anchor": "wifi",
                "image_asset": "jrtrack-watch-wifi-520x1156.webp",
                "image_alt": "Wi-Fi screen on the watch with Wi-Fi switched on, a connected network and a list of nearby networks",
                "caption": "Wi-Fi settings on the watch",
                "figure_position": "side",
                "figure_width": "wide",
                "device": "watch"
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text-10": {
                  "type": "_guide-text",
                  "settings": {
                    "content": "<p>Wi-Fi improves location accuracy when indoors, and it is needed for app downloads and music streaming.</p><ol><li>On the watch, open <strong>Settings</strong>.</li><li>Tap <strong>Wi-Fi</strong> and toggle it on.</li><li>Tap your network and enter the password.</li></ol>",
                    "show_seal": false
                  }
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text-10"
              ]
            }
          },
